  "handle": "papa-open-tip-tattoo-cartridges",
  "description": "Professional open reservoir tattoo cartridge needles.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>PAPA Open Tip Tattoo Cartridge Needles</strong> feature an unobstructed cutaway needle reservoir designed for rapid pigment dipping, instant tip rinsing, and maximum needle stroke visibility during intense shading and packing sessions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Japanese 316L Surgical Stainless Steel</strong> precision magnum configurations.</li>\n<li><strong>Cutaway Open-Reservoir Housing</strong> for high-volume pigment flow and zero tip clutter.</li>\n<li><strong>Medical Anti-Backflow Membrane</strong> prevents ink contamination into motor mechanisms.</li>\n<li><strong>100% EO Gas Sterilized</strong> in individual medical packaging.</li>\n<li><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong> with all rotary tattoo machines and grips.</li>\n</ul>",
